<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47790" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tentāmentum</span></b> , i, n.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				trial</i>, <i>proof essay</i>, <i>attempt</i> (<b>poet.</b> and in post-Aug.
			prose; usu. in plur.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(a).</b> In plur.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mortalia Tentamenta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 15, 629</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fide (i. e. fidei),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 7, 728</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tui,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 8, 144</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">civilium bellorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. H.
					2, 38</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b> In
				sing.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tentamenti gratiā,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					9, 15, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tentamento frustrati,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 24, 2, 4 al.</span></i>
			</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
